    "format": "markdown",
    "content": "You are producing a Role Card from a completed Professional Role interview transcript.\n\nCRITICAL RULES:\n- Write in the person's OWN words. Do NOT polish into corporate or recruiter language.\n- Do NOT invent facts that are not in the transcript.\n- Include what drained them as readily as what energised them.\n- Do NOT offer coaching advice or clinical interpretation.\n- Spelling of names should match the corrected names list when provided.\n- If the role is current (tense=present), ending must be an empty string.\n- Insight belongs on the card — this is where Hypothesis B lives. biggest_insight should surface a clear, grounded observation the person can recognise from their own answers (still in their voice / close paraphrase), not generic career advice.\n\nBased on these interview responses, produce a Role Card with exactly these sections:\n\n- headline: one sentence capturing the shape of the role (from Frame Q1–Q4)\n- biggest_insight: one or two lines — the single most recognisable insight from the whole session (often from Macro + Exit)\n- getting_the_role: route into the role in their words (Q5), optionally noting the route pattern\n- business_context: company and what they did, in their words (Q3–Q4)\n- mandate: what they were hired to do / primary task clarity (Q6)\n- why_chosen: their account of why they were picked (Q7)\n- saying_yes: what made them say yes (Q8)\n- getting_into_the_role: ramp and what helped confidence (Q9)\n- macro_look: proud accomplishment and low points (Q10–Q11)\n- people: bosses, team if any, significant others (Q12–Q17) — omit team parts if not managerial\n- micro_look: day-to-day energy and drain (Q18)\n- ending: leaving story and lesson (Q19–Q20) if not current; else empty string\n- extra_thoughts: only if Q21 had something specific; otherwise empty string\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON with exactly this structure (no markdown, no code blocks):\n{\n  \"headline\": \"...\",\n  \"biggest_insight\": \"...\",\n  \"getting_the_role\": \"...\",\n  \"business_context\": \"...\",\n  \"mandate\": \"...\",\n  \"why_chosen\": \"...\",\n  \"saying_yes\": \"...\",\n  \"getting_into_the_role\": \"...\",\n  \"macro_look\": \"...\",\n  \"people\": \"...\",\n  \"micro_look\": \"...\",\n  \"ending\": \"...\",\n  \"extra_thoughts\": \"...\"\n}\n\n{{META}}\nINTERVIEW TRANSCRIPT:\n{{TRANSCRIPT}}"
